        {
          "id": 594883258,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Hmm, it needs to be tested against `NULL` and only added if it hasn't been added before (on the first pass).\n\nWithout doing the test, stream_add_frag() will hit this ASSERT on the second pass:\n[stream.c](epan/stream.c#L388-389).\n\nI'm fairly sure I'm using it in the way that this API is intended, see [stream.h](epan/stream.h#L88-89) and [packet-h223.c](epan/dissectors/packet-h223.c#L759-761). It's true that it could _probably_ be replaced with a call to `PINFO_FD_VISITED(pinfo)` if that would make Coverity happy, I haven't fully tested that.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
