        {
          "id": 594884514,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Hmm, or did it only give the warning on that one use and not the other? Perhaps adding a call to `stream_process_reassembled()` there would be sufficient? There probably should be one there, I added that particular codepath for a theoretical case that I don't think that Transport Streams will ever encounter (since TS packets are limited to ~188 bytes) so it's slightly less tested than the other parts.",
