      "title": "DVB-S2-BB: Add support for TS over BBFrame",
      "message": "DVB-S2-BB: Add support for TS over BBFrame\n\nAdd support for Transport Streams carried over DVB Base Band Frames,\npassing them to the MP2T dissector. Add an endpoint type for the ISI.\nUpdate comments. Use standard true false strings in a couple cases.\nCreate a header file for MP2T, since the BBFrame dissector needs to\nknow about the MPEG2 TS packet size and sync byte.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-05-28T20:36:30.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
